# Apple private keys — NEVER commit. A tracked .p8 was removed from the
# working tree in the server-trust-layer phase; the owner MUST still
# revoke/rotate it in App Store Connect and purge it from git history
# (see delivery report for the filter-repo commands). History rewrite is
# intentionally NOT done automatically.
*.p8
AuthKey_*.p8

# Private production bank artifacts — answer keys must NEVER be committed.
# Public repo carries schemas, RPCs, metadata, synthetic fixtures, and the
# loader (scripts/load-production-bank.mjs). Production keys travel only
# through the private ops path (see the loader header).
private/
*-production-bank.json
*bank-keys*.json
